# Raspberry Pi Pico W

RP2040 Pico W linked by the Pico SDK external build. The GPIO, default hardware
UART, and monotonic timer facilities are supplied by platform.pico.mcu. Wireless
CYW43 facilities are deliberately outside this board contract; its LED is on the
CYW43 rather than on an RP2040 GPIO and is therefore not reported as a GPIO LED.

Pico WH is the same SDK board with headers fitted and uses this declaration.
